display_name="T6 Front Panel"
desc="Front touch-screen app for the UnifyDrive UP6 / ZSpace T6: dashboard, screen and network info, device settings. Requires T6 Control Center and Appliance Compositor."
changelog="2.1.0: the theme can follow the night: in Settings › Appearance choose At night, and set its hours (22:00–07:00 by default, across midnight if you like). Night desk in the control center then switches to the other theme until the next change of the night hours, and the schedule takes over again. 2.0.2: the tab bar is now dark indigo cloth by day, with the current tab on a pale straw-yellow label, so it stands out from the page from across the room; at night the current tab is an indigo label. The status bar shows every connection in use side by side: Bluetooth, Wi-Fi or the hotspot, and wired. Settings › Screen has one Idle row that opens a page for dimming and turning the screen off. In English, the names of tabs behind in Files fade out instead of being cut mid-word. 2.0.0: a new look on the Ridgeline design system: four tabs (Overview, Files, Network, Settings), a control center pulled down from the status bar, Chinese and English, light by default, and the screen dims before it turns off. Earlier versions: github.com/jiaaom/up6-linux-drivers/releases."

